{
 "batchId": "b-0603",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "ko",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_4e0e9015547258ab56c4",
   "sourceHash": "4e0e9015547258ab56c43a6e83ece604f668dd441a661b2b3f18590def582ec5",
   "text": "환자와 방문객의 다양한 후기, 방문객이 직접 찍은 사진, 최근 경험담을 Google Maps와 Tripadvisor에서 직접 확인하실 수 있습니다.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guest' rendered as 환자와 방문객 (patients and visitors), and 'traveller' as 방문객 (visitor), to follow the KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c1f1a53c493fa0c2470f",
   "sourceHash": "c1f1a53c493fa0c2470f8ddad8dd6c8e251926baa4ac2e4e5117c084417c11ad",
   "text": "여러분의 경험은 소중합니다",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c125a984b5bb6904a90c",
   "sourceHash": "c125a984b5bb6904a90c7a903aa1857ebee0cc70df1922dc5e0259f94a48eadf",
   "text": "저희 병원에 머무신 적이 있으십니까?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_25df085a6508d0ba577a",
   "sourceHash": "25df085a6508d0ba577a414176cec4e2a2ad99bc7f94cfc4b4758bfa9d8279d1",
   "text": "좋았던 점과 개선할 점을 알려 주십시오. 솔직한 경험이라면 어떤 이야기든 환영합니다.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f3ce3fc0d023d3e40a89",
   "sourceHash": "f3ce3fc0d023d3e40a892ad29889d0ae62032656634106bbfc08496c851cbfa6",
   "text": "Kairali에 의견 보내기",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fd90a84103aa1e549a65",
   "sourceHash": "fd90a84103aa1e549a65b0f4293cdeba0c4eb3f1b1882b9343dd73b36fed0d89",
   "text": "Google Maps에 후기 남기기 ↗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e15b06ca0eab188cdccc",
   "sourceHash": "e15b06ca0eab188cdcccf8243469d2f83f848583f6ae5c68e9503346a76aab79",
   "text": "Tripadvisor에 후기 남기기 ↗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_77eb5e9c5aa1f0f1b546",
   "sourceHash": "77eb5e9c5aa1f0f1b54615c18d82f4fef43adf5854a6b77d60ce1df8e60f1325",
   "text": "직접 체류를 계획하고 계십니까?",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e4232a83390f05c1d79b",
   "sourceHash": "e4232a83390f05c1d79be8a442fed41dc563969cf417181f3e0933092f530156",
   "text": "필요하신 사항을 함께 이야기해 보십시오",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_58410930e246832f2ccc",
   "sourceHash": "58410930e246832f2ccc81b5119f701a61c7420e3b3df5227a739e17bb6fefc5",
   "text": "환자 지원팀이 궁금하신 점과 숙소 문제를 도와드리고, 아유르베다 의사 상담을 받기 위한 다음 단계를 안내해 드립니다.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b560b1c1bc37b147b61f",
   "sourceHash": "b560b1c1bc37b147b61f16cdb652078e9bddd07cfab71307bcbd77f81b051aac",
   "text": "무료 의사 상담",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4b9e45a7849e3a481eb5",
   "sourceHash": "4b9e45a7849e3a481eb59e363b9fe349385fbba7c61fca4ee98ead4e5bfc466f",
   "text": "WhatsApp 환자 지원 ↗",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_06d6614ba9f841e1295b",
   "sourceHash": "06d6614ba9f841e1295bea157d269767edd51fdfa7e5053640561e6706af98b0",
   "text": "인도에서, 그리고 전 세계에서.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "The approved term 'From' = 출발지 is a travel-form label (point of departure). It does not fit here, where 'From' is a preposition meaning 'coming from', so the natural phrasing 인도에서 (from India) is used instead. Please confirm."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_02ae17f5ec4fb4b4d6bd",
   "sourceHash": "02ae17f5ec4fb4b4d6bd49aa749e1752273e0788c3524fe7ab11d461510106c3",
   "text": "마음에 와닿는 이야기를 찾아보십시오",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dfea991cb98da9cc33d2",
   "sourceHash": "dfea991cb98da9cc33d22dbfab76e4b0f1d9d1d3bb45a908941a5808d53a6266",
   "text": "환자·방문객 후기와 Kairali가 공개한 자료에서 일부를 발췌했습니다. 전체 내용은 출처에서 확인하실 수 있습니다.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guest reviews' rendered as 환자·방문객 후기 (patient and visitor reviews) to follow the KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b9bcadbc596da558a04d",
   "sourceHash": "b9bcadbc596da558a04d70bc9f8c74e6f231a4545c503fef99f17a60c2cd80dd",
   "text": "방문객 거주 지역",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guest' rendered as 방문객 (visitor) to follow the KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_196cbccb71827c14f48e",
   "sourceHash": "196cbccb71827c14f48edb99fbf0c96c0126f48169e13dce5ccbaebe5a91fd92",
   "text": "전체 방문객",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guests' rendered as 방문객 (visitors) to follow the KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fd2cd1d5f76872314085",
   "sourceHash": "fd2cd1d5f768723140852000c1cb257b454318d6af1fb49991d70d7a179495ce",
   "text": "인도 방문객",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guests' rendered as 방문객 (visitors) to follow the KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2a3b0632cd3591c92599",
   "sourceHash": "2a3b0632cd3591c9259902025012b2e839a0e0407810e5d0b5a84333340b7f96",
   "text": "해외 방문객",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'guests' rendered as 방문객 (visitors) to follow the KTAHV language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0ad7d0a61227eb0a2496",
   "sourceHash": "0ad7d0a61227eb0a249666f105827ed1f35a3c57dc3aa1f59f3abe4e4683e8d4",
   "text": "발췌문 언어:",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment that comes before a language selector. It is rendered as a label ('Excerpt language:') so it fits Korean word order."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e9a5a16504f86acb8edf",
   "sourceHash": "e9a5a16504f86acb8edf4c5ff481d8b67999ebeabb483cf00c14eed0b5a31a40",
   "text": "개의 이야기 ·",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment that follows a number. It uses the counter 개의 so the full phrase reads '<number> stories ·'."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f216d206c094d3dc2323",
   "sourceHash": "f216d206c094d3dc232375413a9b587789c596b4a9ee762aa8ad43ed96739c07",
   "text": "영어 원문 발췌",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_27522f2891dfb74acba1",
   "sourceHash": "27522f2891dfb74acba1ae14482c02d2dc25b46f0d829918767574545fdde284",
   "text": "번역된 발췌문 · 각 카드에서 영어 원문도 확인하실 수 있습니다",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1168bc59127b4dc874d0",
   "sourceHash": "1168bc59127b4dc874d089c3e3d844f12475a08e7642d3fe74edc692dd8aa094",
   "text": ". 방문객 거주 지역은 출처에 명시된 경우에만 표시됩니다.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Guest' rendered as 방문객 (visitor) to follow the KTAHV language lock. The leading-period fragment is preserved."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e965726ad8e0e0d42741",
   "sourceHash": "e965726ad8e0e0d427419c1e10d4c9ecb67c09e36d0fa95fee79f6543f82350b",
   "text": "영어 원문",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
